  merchantTextLines:
  - "So, you brought back the Armorer. Good, I <slide a=.2>suppose </slide>... though
    I see you\u2019re already <wiggle a=.05 f=2>throwing</wiggle> your gems at him."
  - There are <slide a=.2>others</slide> in The Verdant Graveyard who might actually
    be useful.
  - "You\u2019ll meet the Trainer, a <wave a=.2 f=1.5>fool</wave> who believes in
    strength through...<slide a=.2> odd</slide> means."
  - And the Tamer? He might turn that <wiggle a=.05 f=2>barking</wiggle> mutt of
    yours into <slide a=.2>something</slide> worth keeping around.
  - "Let me guess - they\u2019ll want <bounce a=.2 f=1.2>gems</bounce> too?"
  - "Don\u2019t forget <slide a=.2>who</slide> keeps this flame alive. Just make
    sure you bring back <bounce a=.2 f=1.2>enough</bounce> for me next time."
  showShopAfterDialog: 0
